{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:609136aff4c0540e2f5c12365c7121ae770987ee7d5830720abb19ff37d40528",
      "text": "315 Production全员都干劲十足，\n誓要“一定要拿下第一名”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:327806631df030376ee645d8835bfba3ad3f1ba3d8ba5ba6dafa1a56d93c41f0",
      "text": "听说男极会有各种事务所参加，\n但第一名当然想由我们拿下啊！对吧，雨彦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c42fc09a7613a96347c6dfc24f5922d4ba4b49cf74036e7546d69449aa12fb3",
      "text": "哈哈。既然年长的渡边先生都这么说了，\n我也只能点头赞同了吧？山下先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d1fd8db10e0ca7f76acc3101a0ab637a895425172377df26491a3c08e4b0aa5",
      "text": "哎呀，就因为我们同龄就把球踢给我吗？\n哎……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ea16bcb58bd8d7b5f9c535cdc9b12bed83f4b2295e7638a15dc6a64a2ea593",
      "text": "虽然光靠我自己一个人完全没把握。但和大家在一起，\n就觉得下次好像也能取得不错的成绩呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20797f91da8cacfeed87c8dbad203762720733f8555d7441d6a885d98a64fc3a",
      "text": "嗯。我们有许许多多的伙伴，\n而且还有●●●●プロデューサー在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f76bfd5f77567a4f3b36f43351994a715a43ba287ff405dbce05c84afdca0474",
      "text": "没错，只要有我们和制作人在就没问题！\n315 Production，最棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7080e95e24377bfbd190bb8abd380de5cc711cdfd8e0d98de04d4b2b496591a",
      "text": "最棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
